  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 4 June 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted 4 June 2026 and numbered 10, 100 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clauses E(a) and E4 of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed outbuilding includes primary living facilities and the use would not be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse.\r\n",
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 4 June 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted 4 June 2026 and numbered 10, 100 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clause E(a) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the size of the outbuilding is a reasonable requirement for the intended uses and therefore the outbuilding would not be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwelling house.\r\n"
  ],
